_logic", "label": "Streak Logic", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Streak Logic", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_md_translation_cache", "label": "Translation Cache (SSE two-shape)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Translation Cache", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two SSE response shapes must both be handled by frontend: cache hit (full array at once) vs cache miss (streaming partial text events)."}, {"id": "claude_md_lyric_sync_loop", "label": "Lyric Sync Loop (200ms)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Lyric Sync Loop", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_md_spotify_polling", "label": "Spotify Polling (1000ms) + Loop/Pause Detection", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "Spotify Polling", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_md_lrc_parsing", "label": "LRC Parsing (lrcParser.js)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "LRC Parsing", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_md_protected_files", "label": "Protected Files List", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "What NOT to Change Without Asking / Protected files", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "spotifyAuth, getValidSpotifyAccessToken, verifyAuth/verifyAppCheck/checkRateLimit, firebase.js, emulator ports, and .env files must not be touched without explicit approval \u2014 high risk of breaking auth/token flows."}, {"id": "claude_md_hard_rules", "label": "Hard Rules (Verification, Scope Discipline)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.m